        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Also, with the acquisition of the remaining 50% equity interest in Izipay in April 2022, we expanded our capacity to cross-sell products and services and benefit from synergies across all our segments, providing a unique value proposition to our customers.",
