        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our digital product offering, we have developed a suite of innovative tools to enhance the client experience.",
        "start_character": 101629,
        "end_character": 101749
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At Inteligo, we specialize in providing wealth management services, with a focus on delivering innovative digital solutions that cater to the evolving needs of our clients.",
        "start_character": 100625,
        "end_character": 100797
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "At Interbank, we aim to provide the best self-service and automated credit experience for commercial clients by offering them with a 100% digital journey focused on cash management solutions such as Cuenta Negocios, supply chain financing, merchant financing, sustainable loans, and easy and transparent ways of managing payments, such as Cuenta Sueldo and through our affiliate Izipay.",
        "start_character": 83872,
        "end_character": 84258
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The company offers low-cost premium insurance products, such as SOAT, travel insurance, vehicle insurance, and individual life insurance products, simpler than the ones sold by agents.",
        "start_character": 55474,
        "end_character": 55658
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also believe our digital transformation is vital to our continued growth and profitability, and for this reason we have been investing in developing the capabilities necessary to offer digital products and services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 10677,
        "end_character": 10912
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are the majority owner and controlling shareholder of our subsidiaries, Interbank, Interseguro, Inteligo -which comprise our banking, insurance and wealth management segments- and Izipay, our payment services subsidiary.",
        "start_character": 435,
        "end_character": 658
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our digital efforts are vital to our continued growth and profitability, and for this reason we have been investing in developing the capabilities necessary to offer digital products and services to our customers.",
        "start_character": 12921,
        "end_character": 13145
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that both Inteligo’s position as a provider of tailored wealth management services and its ability to provide its customers with both local and international investment products may help increase its share of wallet among high-net-worth individuals, while delivering high levels of growth and profitability.",
        "start_character": 38776,
        "end_character": 39094
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-177617",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-24",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to closely monitor political, social and economic developments in Peru and assess their potential impact on our portfolio, including the need to recognize special provisions when warranted.",
        "start_character": 163545,
        "end_character": 163746
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-177617",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-177617-ddfdf674ea3b4509",
